  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY25-26 ASEAN English Language Training for Officials Strengthening Resilience: Intake 63</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to deliver&#xa0;English Language Training for Officials Strengthening Resilience course to&#xa0;48&#xa0;participants in&#xa0;Southeast Asia and Mongolia. Course to cover&#xa0;language learning, intercultural communication, New Zealand culture, good governance&#xa0;and the principles &amp;amp; approaches to disaster risk reduction in theory &amp;amp; practice in New Zealand, Southeast Asia, Mongolia &amp;amp; worldwide.
The course will be delivered in New Zealand, over&#xa0;13&#xa0;weeks, commencing in May 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
